{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0453_1000_null", "source_sha256": "163b980631f6473635c2be9be121b33e607cca43a156ec16d77f238a59e28b80", "ja": "CM撮影終了後……", "zh": "CM拍摄结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0453_1001_401pro", "source_sha256": "9d9bb8c88a805dfc2a3de8da5bbc70a671516e013b3ab6bc96ed372fdedc4efb", "ja": "あ、いたいた。\n海美、そろそろ時間だ。帰りの準備をしてくれ。", "zh": "啊，找到了。\n海美，差不多到时间了。准备回去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0453_1002_029umi", "source_sha256": "77fc1df1eff7315f0602012ea7894c77ed843e71a9fea88f0fa261cede3f280e", "ja": "えーっ！？　もう帰らなきゃダメ？", "zh": "诶——！？已经必须回去了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0453_1003_401pro", "source_sha256": "c8d14cc7327d4594cc38e648554bc45318b9e2b9edda87345417e30a7fe56412", "ja": "さすがに日も暮れ始めてるからな。\n……撮影、そんなに楽しかったのか？", "zh": "毕竟天都开始黑了。  \n……拍摄真的有那么开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0453_1004_029umi", "source_sha256": "995638f43c5d8d7ac630aad539662d9335c45e0826a5fb50873aa430f76b0762", "ja": "うん！　すっっっごく、楽しかった！\n……だから……もうちょっと……。", "zh": "嗯！特别特别开心！\n……所以……再多拍一会儿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0453_1005_401pro", "source_sha256": "91be407b73fb337bd34f90268cb10c920e77adce0e4bef976370104a901f6b1c", "ja": "なるほどな……。でもほら、次の仕事は、\n今日よりもっと楽しいかもしれないぞ？", "zh": "原来如此……不过你看，下次的工作，说不定会比今天更开心哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0453_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0453_1007_401pro", "source_sha256": "20eb8e0924edf3de464e719263a89c23d25a0d4a268c2c963880a1efcae189ec", "ja": "次の仕事を思いっきり楽しむためにも、\n今日は早く帰って、ゆっくり休まないと。", "zh": "为了尽情享受下一份工作，今天也得早点回去好好休息才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0453_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "35f94e4c8dc40516db2b3ab5d44d3e6fa3621915d54275dc4ee5a953259a25a8", "ja": "……そっか。\nアイドルって、今日で終わりじゃないんだ……。", "zh": "……这样啊。\n当偶像，并不是今天就结束了呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0453_1009_029umi", "source_sha256": "c2cdcc9fef3d31c8c0a4237eb1dfa9d3be6bc4f3666086a9b045ddcdaee9bc3c", "ja": "私……明日からも、アイドルなんだ……！\n……えへっ、えへへへへ～☆", "zh": "我……从明天起，还是偶像呢……！\n……嘿嘿，嘿嘿嘿嘿嘿～☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0453_1010_401pro", "source_sha256": "1182f92d6bf523975f6691ceebd508633b68704f60d5ecae5d3d34fdff0ab863", "ja": "……これからも海美には、いろんな\n仕事をしてもらうから。よろしく！", "zh": "……今后海美还要负责\n各种各样的工作呢。请多指教啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0453_1011_029umi", "source_sha256": "e96e92086a3e52c3b4a749556dd96b93a6af0ae159454c1c5492c8063d1401e0", "ja": "うんっ、いっぱいまかせて！\nそれで、次はどんなお仕事するの？？", "zh": "嗯！尽管交给我吧！\n那么，接下来要做什么工作呢？？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0453_1012_401pro", "source_sha256": "72bcd8dfc923e5e9c41afcde1bd04fbc1ffb2f3b63db5a9f64af8ab065ffb2bf", "ja": "えっ、それは……あはは、気が早いな？", "zh": "诶，这个嘛……哈哈，你也太心急了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0453_1013_029umi", "source_sha256": "154aa25d0a600cd6aa8b74f5bf7e778e558edd5ad39791de10f36a006df0d3da", "ja": "だってプロデューサーが次の話するから！！\nねえねえ、教えてよー！", "zh": "因为制作人在说下次的事嘛！！\n告诉我嘛，告诉我嘛——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0453_1014_401pro", "source_sha256": "67c39747fc6c4587d0510b81ff23ffe20fff12043c77ffd7d0a2e6b9930ae60b", "ja": "ええっと……、ごめん！\nさすがにまだ決まってないんだ……。", "zh": "那个……抱歉！确实还没决定好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0453_1015_029umi", "source_sha256": "375aa6acea4e9ddebcc1b792fe13c5698791b93b6a4c4915ddf84058814f7c37", "ja": "えーーーっ！？　……じゃあ、やっぱり帰らない。\n決まるまでここにいる～っ！", "zh": "诶——！？……那我果然还是不回去了。\n在决定下来之前，我要一直待在这里～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0453_1016_401pro", "source_sha256": "604b7e12f9d51df5cefd3d897c719d097804049b1cc47ac3f12a6b4084c618a5", "ja": "い、いや大丈夫！　すぐに新しい仕事を取って\nくるから、一緒に帰ろう、な？", "zh": "不、不用担心！我马上就去接新的工作，一起回去吧，好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0453_1017_029umi", "source_sha256": "8e0f6d5d0175a79160472311c23bd350b386c7d113f38d9fc9eabdea7a749f7e", "ja": "本当？　……約束だよ？", "zh": "真的？……说好了哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0453_1018_401pro", "source_sha256": "e3baf01c8f7703153129db01d7d22384d14cfe11f76f20e7e494a917a28aef62", "ja": "ああ、約束する。\n海美たちなら、きっとすぐだ！", "zh": "啊，我保证。\n有海美她们在，肯定很快就能做到！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0453_1019_029umi", "source_sha256": "a9261b9a21649abe1aa046ecf9af7739c9b626e384ae0aab6225b04fff7459c3", "ja": "……えへへ、ありがと！\nそれじゃあ、指切りの代わりに……。", "zh": "……嘿嘿，谢谢！\n那就用这个代替拉钩……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0453_1020_029umi", "source_sha256": "51b2cb14b7cd222e7e6bdb1089df637ccb5eacb41eab0dc44fcc2160b02b5eda", "ja": "車まで競走しよっ！\nよーい、ドンッ☆", "zh": "我们比赛跑到车那里吧！预备——跑☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0453_1021_401pro", "source_sha256": "362632620e428006c9d72926f544450fe419ccb1e581476f7147acedddd21197", "ja": "え？　ちょ、ちょっと待って！\nは、速い……！", "zh": "诶？等、等一下！\n好、好快……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0453_1022_029umi", "source_sha256": "81dd35fa9e5c650cc5fe6426c1059828c331f599c56976c229ad6587891b0356", "ja": "プロデューサー！　はやく来てねー！\n私、ちょっと先に行って、待ってるからねーーー☆", "zh": "制作人！快点过来哦——！\n我先走一步，在前面等你哦——☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
